stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Setup
    Setup --> RollInitiative
    RollInitiative --> RollInitiative: Tie
    RollInitiative --> BeginPlayerTurn: Player wins
    RollInitiative --> BeginEnemyTurn: Enemy wins

    BeginPlayerTurn --> PlayerMovement
    PlayerMovement --> PlayerAction: Move, skip, or no legal move
    PlayerAction --> ResolvePlayerAction: Attack or potion
    ResolvePlayerAction --> CheckOutcome

    BeginEnemyTurn --> EvaluateEnemyAI
    EvaluateEnemyAI --> EnemyMovement: Player out of range
    EvaluateEnemyAI --> ResolveEnemyAttack: Player in range
    EnemyMovement --> ResolveEnemyAttack: Player in range after movement
    EnemyMovement --> CheckOutcome: Player still out of range
    ResolveEnemyAttack --> CheckOutcome

    CheckOutcome --> Victory: Enemy HP is zero
    CheckOutcome --> Defeat: Player HP is zero
    CheckOutcome --> BeginEnemyTurn: Player action completed
    CheckOutcome --> BeginPlayerTurn: Enemy action completed

    Defeat --> Setup: Retry from snapshot
    Defeat --> [*]: Abandon run
    Victory --> ApplyRewards
    ApplyRewards --> [*]
